<title>AUSTRIA: Wiener St'sche 8-mth premium income up.</title>
<headline>Wiener St'sche 8-mth premium income up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian insurance company Wiener Staedtische said on Thursday its premium income for the first eight months rose 14.4 percent.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						     1-8/96	 1-8/95</p>
<p>    Premium income			    12,737	  +14.4 pct</p>
<p>    Insurance payments			 6,952	   +7.7 pct</p>
<p>    Operating expenses			 2,878	   +4.2 pct</p>
<p>    Workforce				    3,940	   -2.1 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Wiener Staedtische Allgemeine Versicherung AG.</p>
</text>
